---
/*
  Listado del blog (/blog, /en/blog): la entrada más reciente en grande y el resto en rejilla, con filtros por tema
  (consejos · inspiración · nuestras cosas). Termina con el cierre de siempre.
*/
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ClosingCta from '../home/ClosingCta.astro';
import { home } from '../../content/home';
import { blogUi, getPosts, postHref, readingMinutes, formatDate } from '../../lib/blog';
import { emphasize, type Lang } from '../../i18n/routes';

interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const c = blogUi[lang];
const posts = await getPosts(lang);
const [first, ...rest] = posts;
const meta = (p: (typeof posts)[number]) => `${formatDate(p.data.date, lang)} · ${c.readingTime.replace('{n}', String(readingMinutes(p)))}`;
const filters = [['todas', c.all], ...Object.entries(c.categories)] as [string, string][];
---

<BaseLayout lang={lang} routeKey="blog" title={c.meta.title} description={c.meta.description}>
  <!-- Introducción y filtros -->
  <section class="bg-porcelana-50 pb-10 pt-14 md:pb-14 md:pt-20">
    <div class="container-brand flex flex-col gap-10 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
      <div class="flex max-w-[44rem] flex-col gap-6" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-line text-malva-500">{c.eyebrow}</p>
        <h1 class="display-xl text-pino-800" set:html={emphasize(c.title)} />
        <p class="lead max-w-[36rem]">{c.lead}</p>
        {c.note && <p class="text-[0.8125rem] italic text-suave">{c.note}</p>}
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:shrink-0 md:flex-nowrap md:justify-end" role="group" aria-label={c.filterLabel} data-blog-filters data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:120ms">
        {filters.map(([value, label], i) => (
          <button type="button" class="blog-chip" data-filter={value} aria-pressed={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}>{label}</button>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-porcelana-50 pb-20 md:pb-28">
    <div class="container-brand flex flex-col gap-14" data-blog-list>
      <!-- La más reciente -->
      {
        first && (
          <article class="blog-item" data-category={first.data.category} data-reveal>
            <a href={postHref(first)} class="group grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-12">
              <div class="overflow-hidden">
                <Picture
                  src={first.data.cover}
                  alt={first.data.coverAlt}
                  widths={[640, 960, 1280]}
                  sizes="(min-width: 768px) 55vw, 100vw"
                  formats={['avif', 'webp']}
                  loading="eager"
                  class="aspect-[3/2] w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.03] motion-reduce:transition-none"
                  style={first.data.coverFocus ? `object-position:${first.data.coverFocus}` : undefined}
                />
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                <p class="eyebrow text-malva-500">{c.featured} · {c.categories[first.data.category]}</p>
                <h2 class="display-l text-pino-800 group-hover:text-ciruela-700">{first.data.title}</h2>
                <p class="text-suave">{first.data.description}</p>
                <p class="text-[0.8125rem] text-suave">{meta(first)}</p>
              </div>
            </a>
          </article>
        )
      }

      <!-- El resto -->
      <ul class="grid gap-x-8 gap-y-14 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {rest.map((p) => (
          <li class="blog-item" data-category={p.data.category} data-reveal>
            <a href={postHref(p)} class="group flex flex-col gap-3">
              <div class="overflow-hidden">
                <Picture
                  src={p.data.cover}
                  alt={p.data.coverAlt}
                  widths={[400, 640, 800]}
                  sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30vw, (min-width: 640px) 46vw, 100vw"
                  formats={['avif', 'webp']}
                  class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.03] motion-reduce:transition-none"
                  style={p.data.coverFocus ? `object-position:${p.data.coverFocus}` : undefined}
                />
              </div>
              <p class="eyebrow mt-2 text-malva-500">{c.categories[p.data.category]}</p>
              <h2 class="display-s text-pino-800 group-hover:text-ciruela-700">{p.data.title}</h2>
              <p class="text-[0.9375rem] text-suave">{p.data.description}</p>
              <p class="text-[0.8125rem] text-suave">{meta(p)}</p>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ClosingCta lang={lang} c={home[lang].closing} />
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  // Filtros por tema: ocultan las entradas que no coinciden.
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-blog-filters]').forEach((group) => {
    const list = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-blog-list]');
    if (!list) return;
    const buttons = [...group.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-filter]')];
    buttons.forEach((b) =>
      b.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const f = b.dataset.filter;
        buttons.forEach((x) => x.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(x === b)));
        list.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.blog-item').forEach((item) => {
          item.hidden = f !== 'todas' && item.dataset.category !== f;
          item.classList.add('is-revealed');
        });
      }),
    );
  });
</script>

<style>
  .blog-chip {
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-linea);
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-pino-800);
    transition: background-color 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
  }
  .blog-chip:hover { border-color: var(--color-pino-800); }
  .blog-chip[aria-pressed='true'] { background: var(--color-pino-800); border-color: var(--color-pino-800); color: #fff; }
</style>
